      "content": "Symptoms: Postgres connection is throwing Too Many Clients. Prisma is crashing on queries.\nFix: In the .env file, add ?connection_limit=5 to the DATABASE_URL. Update the Prisma client instantiation to use a global object in development to prevent hot-reloading from creating zombie connections."
